    christmas7: makeChristmasPreset('Rustic Farmhouse Christmas','Warm rustic Christmas graphics with simple evergreen sprigs, wooden-sign influence, buffalo check, bells, wreaths, and cozy country character.','Farmhouse decor fans, country Christmas shoppers, family gift buyers, and rustic seasonal apparel customers.',['cozy','homey','traditional'],['neon','futuristic','glamorous'],[{hex:'#8E302B',name:'Barn Red',role:'primary'},{hex:'#F1E5CE',name:'Linen Cream',role:'background'},{hex:'#3F5B45',name:'Evergreen',role:'secondary'},{hex:'#6B4B38',name:'Wood Brown',role:'outline'},{hex:'#B99858',name:'Antique Gold',role:'accent'}],'Friendly rustic serif or bold country sign lettering with thick readable strokes and restrained hand-lettered accents.','Flat rustic holiday illustration with evergreen sprigs, bells, wreath forms, buffalo-check accents, and country sign character.','medium hand-inked outlines','muted solid fills with small plaid accents','stylized rustic graphic','medium','Keep the requested subject central and use farmhouse Christmas motifs as restrained supporting details.','centered country emblem or loose wreath lockup','subject and phrase first','open outer silhouette','balanced and slightly handmade',['simple wreath arcs','wood-sign curves','plaid blocks'],['evergreen','bells','berries','buffalo check'],['light woodcut grain','subtle ink wear'],'light',['Keep the design warm and simple','Use rustic texture sparingly','Keep text readable'],['No photoreal wood signs','No full room scenes','No excessive farmhouse clutter']),
