    christmas9: makeChristmasPreset('Spooky Christmas','Playful spooky Christmas mixing friendly ghosts, skeletons, black cats, ornaments, stockings, candy canes, and winter holiday motifs. Creepy-cute rather than gruesome.','Alternative Christmas shoppers, spooky-season fans, goth-lite holiday buyers, and people who keep Halloween energy through December.',['mischievous','festive','spooky-cute'],['gore','serious horror','traditional formal'],[{hex:'#26232A',name:'Midnight',role:'primary'},{hex:'#F1E5D3',name:'Ghost Cream',role:'background'},{hex:'#A53A3A',name:'Cranberry',role:'accent'},{hex:'#48624A',name:'Haunted Pine',role:'secondary'},{hex:'#C8A34A',name:'Moon Gold',role:'highlight'}],'Rounded retro holiday lettering with playful spooky character and thick readable strokes.','Flat spooky-cute Christmas illustration with friendly ghosts, skeletons, cats, ornaments, stockings, stars, and tiny winter accents.','clean medium outlines','solid muted fills','stylized spooky-cute graphic','medium','Make the searched subject festive and gently spooky; keep expressions charming rather than frightening.','centered character-led holiday cluster','character first, phrase second','clear outer margin','balanced with quirky offsets',['rounded ghosts','simple bones','holiday curves'],['ghosts','ornaments','stockings','stars'],['subtle vintage print grain'],'none to light',['Keep it creepy-cute, not scary','Blend spooky and Christmas motifs','Keep one clear hero'],['No gore','No realistic horror','No demonic imagery']),
