    christmas15: makeChristmasPreset('Christmas Clay Cute','Creepy-free cute handmade polymer-clay Christmas art with chunky sculpted forms, rounded characters, visible fingerprints, tiny dents, matte clay texture, and collectible miniature charm.','Cute Christmas shoppers, clay-art fans, family gift buyers, teachers, and people who love handcrafted miniature holiday characters.',['adorable','playful','cozy'],['horror','sleek vector','realistic humans'],[{hex:'#B8443E',name:'Clay Red',role:'primary'},{hex:'#F1E2CC',name:'Clay Cream',role:'background'},{hex:'#5F7B5B',name:'Clay Pine',role:'secondary'},{hex:'#D4A14A',name:'Clay Gold',role:'accent'},{hex:'#6D4A42',name:'Cocoa Clay',role:'outline'}],'Chunky rounded lettering with raised clay-like character and strong readability.','Handmade polymer-clay holiday illustration with rounded sculpted forms, visible fingerprints, tiny dents, matte texture, and layered miniature details.','soft sculpted edges','matte clay-like fills','stylized handcrafted 3D','high','Sculpt the requested subject as one cute Christmas clay hero with a few miniature seasonal details.','centered collectible figurine composition','character first, phrase second','clean transparent breathing room','balanced and playful',['rounded clay forms','tiny sculpted details','chunky silhouettes'],['ornaments','trees','gifts','snowflakes'],['matte clay','fingerprint texture'],'none',['Keep clay texture visibly handmade','Keep the hero large and cute','Use simple seasonal props'],['No glossy plastic CGI','No photoreal humans','No background diorama']),
